{"id":"4e0519dfba73bcec3a28377610835ccacc0d6391","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/ai/KW4ChhveDJVpOjl1.html","title":"具身智能开始进入「下半场」：从会干活到干完活 | 雷峰网","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"拉格朗日用 Agentic OS 和工序重构，让机器人在工厂把任务闭环跑完。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"具身智能开始进入「下半场」：从会干活到干完活\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafNUFbXNiaczykuyOicfPn2yrvibvc58lmmicXpjsmSyPS6iae5hicS4pevg0fibG5Hh35GTic4kicc1UYbfbbaApbkDpNtUwxkIYhCaAeo0/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"300\" data-imgfileid=\"100258246\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260817/6a82813982374.jpg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1000\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260817/6a82813982374.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">拉格朗日用 Agentic OS 和工序重构，让机器人在工厂把任务闭环跑完。</span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mqgbkegzw9n\"></span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mpmlbwxl8oz\"></span><span data-lark-record-data=\"{&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;FdZe